{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16990","headline":"秋怀奉寄朱补阙 · 武元衡","name":"秋怀奉寄朱补阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上苑繁霜降，骚人起恨初。\n白云深陋巷，衰草遍闲居。\n暮色秋烟重，寒声牖叶虚。\n潘生秋思苦，陶令世情疎。\n已制归田赋，犹陈谏猎书。\n不知青琐客，投分竟何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}